{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Convergence Point",
    "steam_appid": 3559950,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559950/extras/2ebe85d916ecaffd9142b9670ef63b09.avif?t=1749849160\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convergence point </strong>is a thrilling top-down 2D rogue-like where you play as a stealthy, shape-shifting alien fragment. Your mission is to escape a high-security lab by possessing unsuspecting human hosts and using their bodies as temporary tools for survival. As you navigate through procedurally-generated levels, you'll need to jump from body to body, avoiding capture and outsmarting increasingly dangerous enemies. In your vulnerable goo state, you're an easy target\u2014blend in, strike quickly, and stay hidden to master the art of possession and become the ultimate predator in a world that wants you squished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for keyboard/mouse and controllers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WASD or left joystick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >possession: spacebar or Left trigger (L2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >attacks: keyboard (I, O, P) or Controller (square, x and right trigger (R2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pause: tab or options for controllers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nothing Stays The Same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s procedurally-generated levels and evolving challenges create a fresh experience every time you play, keeping the tension high as you race against time and resource management. Players must carefully plan their movements, sneak through vents, avoid detection, and possess enemies to use their abilities. Whether it's solving puzzles or defeating enemies, the key to success lies in mastering the art of body-hopping while staying one step ahead of increasingly dangerous foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Possession Is Key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your key survival tool is the ability to possess human hosts, using their bodies to infiltrate deeper into the lab. However, your hosts are temporary\u2014each one decays rapidly, forcing you to constantly move and find new targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559950/extras/2ebe85d916ecaffd9142b9670ef63b09.avif?t=1749849160\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convergence point </strong>is a thrilling top-down 2D rogue-like where you play as a stealthy, shape-shifting alien fragment. Your mission is to escape a high-security lab by possessing unsuspecting human hosts and using their bodies as temporary tools for survival. As you navigate through procedurally-generated levels, you'll need to jump from body to body, avoiding capture and outsmarting increasingly dangerous enemies. In your vulnerable goo state, you're an easy target\u2014blend in, strike quickly, and stay hidden to master the art of possession and become the ultimate predator in a world that wants you squished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for keyboard/mouse and controllers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WASD or left joystick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >possession: spacebar or Left trigger (L2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >attacks: keyboard (I, O, P) or Controller (square, x and right trigger (R2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pause: tab or options for controllers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nothing Stays The Same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s procedurally-generated levels and evolving challenges create a fresh experience every time you play, keeping the tension high as you race against time and resource management. Players must carefully plan their movements, sneak through vents, avoid detection, and possess enemies to use their abilities. Whether it's solving puzzles or defeating enemies, the key to success lies in mastering the art of body-hopping while staying one step ahead of increasingly dangerous foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Possession Is Key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your key survival tool is the ability to possess human hosts, using their bodies to infiltrate deeper into the lab. However, your hosts are temporary\u2014each one decays rapidly, forcing you to constantly move and find new targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Starting as a weak, vulnerable goo-like creature, you must stealthily navigate the labyrinthine facility, evading capture and adapting to increasingly hostile security. Your key survival tool is the ability to possess human hosts, using their bodies to infiltrate deeper into the lab.",
